      "description": "Navy house card with stepped gable holding the Danish word and speaker.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-prompt\"><div class=\"ds-p\">Danish word</div><div class=\"ds-big\">en hund</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-prompt{position:relative;background:#17315c;color:#fff;border-radius:6px 6px 22px 22px;margin-top:34px;padding:26px 20px 22px;text-align:center;min-height:190px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-prompt::before,.ds-prompt::after{content:'';position:absolute;background:#17315c;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}.ds-prompt::before{width:62%;height:10px;top:-10px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0}.ds-prompt::after{width:30%;height:10px;top:-20px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0}.ds-p{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;color:rgb(255 255 255 / .8)}.ds-big{font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.1;margin:8px 0 4px}"
